  "notes": [
    "Baseline R-RELEASE-1.baseline-0044 requires migrations 0033 through 0044 applied with the pinned sha256 each (no post-apply rewrite). 0040 (recording_leases + idx_recording_leases_holder), 0041 (recording_chunks + recording_finals + order/state indexes) and 0042 (chunk_keys lease_generation/object_path/max_bytes + idx_chunk_keys_bound) close the ROW28 unsafe window. 0043 adds the server-authoritative early-end fields on competitions plus the separate competition_result_credits ledger (UNIQUE competition/competitor/source; stars 0/10 only), and its columns/table/indexes are now required by the gate. 0044 (UNIT36.1) adds the ad pricing/control/house surface: advertisements.is_house/media_kind/duration_sec, ad_impressions.charged_cents, and the user_ad_policy + user_ad_grants tables with their indexes; its columns/tables/indexes are now required by the gate.",
    "known_history is membership-only (names the repo state at baseline); integrity hashes are enforced for required_migrations.",
    "The gate never applies migrations. Unexpected applied and pending migrations are recorded and FAIL the gate; neither is auto-applied."
  ]
